# Labeled synthetic history; intercepted fixture requests only, no live inference.
name: Bounded usage history preserves an older baseline through refresh and restart
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: NODE_OPTIONS KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL NO_COLOR
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/usage_history.py @TMP_TARGET @ART seed @TMP_HOME
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
paste-file: @ART/future-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 3 planned | finite-future-plan
nav-mode:
keys: a
require-live-snap: 25 PLAN A STUDY | saved-plan-and-spending
expect: 4 committed / 6 total
keys: Down Down Down Down Down Down Down
require-live-snap: 20 most recent 100 | bounded-history
expect: Observed:
ask: Does the screen disclose the history window, preserve the explicitly chosen older baseline and separate unknown dollars from recorded requests?
keys: NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage
require-live-snap: 20 Usage evidence: | older-baseline-identity
resize: 160x48
live-snap: usage-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: usage-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: usage-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: usage-60x20
resize: 40x12
live-snap: usage-40x12
keys: NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage NPage
live-snap: usage-tail-40x12
ask: At 40x12, are the selected evidence and all detail reachable with visible paging and back controls, including after resize?
resize: 120x36
keys: PPage PPage PPage PPage PPage PPage PPage PPage PPage PPage
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/usage_history.py @TMP_TARGET @ART break
keys: r
require-live-snap: 20 Historical usage unavailable | failed-baseline-refresh
expect: 4 committed / 6 total
ask: Does refresh expose the unreadable baseline without clearing selection, changing the draft or presenting missing charges as zero?
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/usage_history.py @TMP_TARGET @ART restore
keys: r
require-live-snap: 20 Observed: | recovered-baseline-refresh
expect: 4 committed / 6 total
keys: L
require-live-snap: 25 REVIEW PLAN & ALLOWANCE | exact-plan-approval
keys: End
require-live-snap: 20 y approve | approval-last
ask: Does the allowance approval retain its exact proposed terms and uncertain usage estimate after background history refresh?
keys: n
require-live-snap: 20 PLAN A STUDY | cancelled-approval
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/usage_history.py @TMP_TARGET @ART verify
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 15 BATCH usage-future | original-campaign
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
paste-file: @ART/future-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 3 planned | saved-unstarted-jobs
nav-mode:
keys: a
require-live-snap: 25 PLAN A STUDY | restored-usage-plan
keys: Down Down Down Down Down Down Down
require-live-snap: 20 most recent 100 | usage-after-restart
expect: Observed:
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/usage_history.py @TMP_TARGET @ART verify
ask: Does no-color restart recover the older baseline, history limit and unchanged spending without approving or starting new work?
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 15 BATCH usage-future | restored-origin
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
